{"4315930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Race Performance Manager", "steam_appid": 4315930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, test and evolve your own race car then prove it on the track.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Performance Manager is a deep, engineering driven motorsport management sim where every decision is proven on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just managing a team, you are shaping the car itself. From the first prototype to race day, every component, upgrade and test is under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Engineering Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of 12 core car components, each with up to 10 levels of development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade depends on your team’s expertise, success is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, research and refine individual parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evaluate real performance gains through testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your competitive edge through smart engineering decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/b0526d2d0010aaa7a31c1ab0fc191040.avif?t=1786832421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras_big/b0526d2d0010aaa7a31c1ab0fc191040.avif?t=1786832421 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The New Car Launch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and execute your team’s most critical moment: the New Car Launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After months of development, select exactly which components will define your new car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your best innovations and bring your next championship contender to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/59f1c2c18a3fd22e4bebd2d6e3d2ba9e.avif?t=1786832421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras_big/59f1c2c18a3fd22e4bebd2d6e3d2ba9e.webp?t=1786832421 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Testing &amp; Wind Tunnel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond simple numbers, analyze how your car truly behaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure drag and downforce coefficients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor engine heat, braking performance, and airflow impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe how your car reacts under high speed conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your engineering decisions come alive through real testing environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/da89700ed1d435ca4345771c51685009.poster.avif?t=1786832421\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/da89700ed1d435ca4345771c51685009.webm?t=1786832421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/da89700ed1d435ca4345771c51685009.mp4?t=1786832421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Data to Performance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Validation is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run controlled test bench simulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send test drivers to the test track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sensor data like floor wear and component stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine your setup and ensure your car performs under real conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/8bb9e40f24dc325073176f07c819899d.avif?t=1786832421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras_big/8bb9e40f24dc325073176f07c819899d.avif?t=1786832421 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Weekend &amp; Season Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a 10 race season where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friday Practice:  Test and refine your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saturday Qualifying: Fight for grid position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunday Race: Execute your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consistency, preparation and precision will define your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/1a944a27d8667a6072fa53703c706483.avif?t=1786832421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras_big/1a944a27d8667a6072fa53703c706483.webp?t=1786832421 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, test and evolve your own race car then prove it on the track.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Performance Manager is a deep, engineering driven motorsport management sim where every decision is proven on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just managing a team, you are shaping the car itself. From the first prototype to race day, every component, upgrade and test is under your control.</p><p class