</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a 10 race season where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friday Practice:  Test and refine your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saturday Qualifying: Fight for grid position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunday Race: Execute your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consistency, preparation and precision will define your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras/1a944a27d8667a6072fa53703c706483.avif?t=1786832421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/extras_big/1a944a27d8667a6072fa53703c706483.webp?t=1786832421 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A deep motorsport management sim where you design, develop and test your own race cars. Lead your team to glory by researching advanced parts, releasing upgrades, training elite drivers and validating your engineering on the track. Turn performance into results and dominate the competition.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/1ae95cec46f134733c766e0d0dd8c88502435f71/header.jpg?t=1786832421", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/e403c765278bc1ec518ff189510ac91aaa1ae5ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786832421", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315930/e403c765278bc1ec518ff189510ac91aaa1ae5ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786832421", "website": "https://www.raceperformancemanager.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bi